OL,3,GNEWSAThe best of Devon honoured at
OL,4,Aawards ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy alpaca, a rowing captain and
OL,7,Fa men's mental health group which was
OL,8,Fdeveloped around the making of artisan
OL,9,Fpizzas, have all been celebrated at a
OL,10,Fspecial ceremony in Devon.
OL,12,FThe winners of the BBC Radio Devon Make
OL,13,Fa Difference Awards 2026 were announced
OL,14,Fin Buckfast Abbey on Thursday.
OL,16,FThe awards, which are in their fifth
OL,17,Fyear, recognise and celebrate the
OL,18,Funsung people and groups who make a
OL,19,Fdifference in their communities across
OL,20,Fthe county.
